-
-    # NOTE(sang): Definition of context_len, query_len, and seq_len.
-    # |---------- N-1 iteration --------|
-    # |---------------- N iteration ---------------------|
-    # |- tokenA -|......................|-- newTokens ---|
-    # |---------- context_len ----------|
-    # |-------------------- seq_len ----------------------|
-    #                                   |-- query_len ---|
-
-    # Maximum query length in the batch. None for decoding.
